  "visual_observation": {
    "observed_identity": "Elegant slender adult praying mantis duelist. Exact triangular pale-jade/lilac chitin head, narrow amber insect eyes, two fine antennae, segmented mantis forelimbs with long curved natural blades, long lean digitigrade insect legs, folded leaf-shaped wing covers at hips/back, fitted dark obsidian-plum waistcoat and long split purple panels with restrained gold trim. Preserve her exact tall narrow body proportions and delicate joint structure.",
    "anatomy": "Sira has the original mantis bladed forelimbs, NOT human fists, gloves, furry paws or ordinary human arms. Adapt punch/guard/support actions to her natural segmented forelimbs and their blade edges. Do not add an extra pair of arms, lose the folded wing covers, enlarge the head/eyes, shorten the antennae, or change insect foot shapes.",
    "transform": "Transformation uses only a subtly brighter existing amber eye color and very restrained highlights along EXISTING pale-jade/lilac chitin edges. No new blades, armor, gems, light beams or glowing symbols."
  },
